 .content-flex {
   flex: 1 1 65%;
 }
+
+/* Folio (2026-11-26, Sammy: "the logo is so small"): the Folio illustration on error / info pages is as big as the new
+   tab's F (150 px), with the text on its right. The page paints no background of its own: Folio's window puts the
